4. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY

   (a) The Software embodies original works of authorship, trade secrets,
       patentable inventions, and proprietary mathematical and theoretical
       frameworks, including but not limited to:

       - The Salvi Framework bijective ternary logic system
       - The Unified 13D Torsion Plenum Theory implementation
       - Tribonacci-derived constant architecture (tau-based)
       - GF(3) Galois Field arithmetic implementations
       - Phase Encryption methodology and algorithms
       - High-Precision Timing Protocol (HPTP)
       - Ternary Virtual Machine (35-opcode ISA)
       - Ternary Hardware Description Language (THDL)
       - Ternary System Language (TSL)
       - PlenumDB compression and storage architecture
       - CNSA 2.0 / FIPS 140-3 compliance implementations
       - Kong API gateway service architecture
       - Blockchain integration protocols (Algorand, Hedera, Oracle Bridge)

